cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software in your research, please cite this software package
  and the original TLP-R2S research article.
title: 'tlpr2s: A Python Package for Passive Microwave Rainfall and Snowfall Retrievals
  Using Incremental Learning'
type: software
authors:
- given-names: Buddha
  family-names: Subedi
  affiliation: University of Minnesota
abstract: A Python implementation of the TLP-R2S incremental learning framework linking
  atmospheric reanalysis and radar observations for satellite passive microwave rainfall
  and snowfall retrievals.
url: https://pypi.org/project/tlpr2s/
keywords:
- Passive microwave
- Precipitation retrieval
- Rainfall
- Snowfall
- Incremental learning
- Transfer learning
- Deep learning
- ERA5
- GPM
- CloudSat
- Satellite remote sensing
- Python
